sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant R1 as Robot finishing step A
  participant API as DSA web (WorkflowProcessesController)
  participant WF as PG workflow (workflow_steps)
  participant NS as Workflow::NextStepService
  participant RR as Robots Redis
  participant R2 as Robot for step B
  participant SOLR as Solr argo_env
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ sdr.workflow

  R1->>API: PUT /v1/objects/druid/workflows/wf/processes/A status completed
  API->>WF: update step A in a transaction
  API->>NS: enqueue_next_steps(step A)
  NS->>WF: find waiting steps whose prerequisites are complete
  NS->>WF: lock rows, set status queued
  NS->>RR: QueueService.enqueue: push job to queue wf_lane or wf_process_lane
  opt step errored or accessionWF end-accession completed
    NS->>MQ: publish process.status
  end
  NS->>SOLR: Indexer.reindex_by_druid (synchronous)
  RR->>R2: Sidekiq worker pops job
  R2->>API: PUT processes/B status started
  API->>NS: enqueue_next_steps (nothing new ready, reindex)
  R2->>R2: perform_work
  R2->>API: PUT processes/B status completed (or error)
  API->>NS: enqueue_next_steps(step B), repeat
  Note over R2,API: DSA-hosted robots update WF in-process via Workflow::ProcessService instead of HTTP
